# Evocation spell names + descriptions.
spell-acid_splash = Acid Splash
spell-acid_splash-desc = Hurl a tiny orb of caustic fluid that bursts at a chosen point, spattering everyone nearby. Those caught in the splash take searing acid damage unless they dodge clear.
spell-booming_blade = Booming Blade
spell-booming_blade-desc = The caster wreaths a melee weapon in humming resonance and strikes a foe within reach. The blow rings with crashing sound, jolting the target with a concussive shock.
spell-eldritch_blast = Eldritch Blast
spell-eldritch_blast-desc = Crackling threads of raw energy lance from the caster's fingertips toward chosen foes. Each requires a precise ranged strike and scorches its target with pure force.
spell-frostbite = Frostbite
spell-frostbite-desc = A bite of numbing frost crystallizes over a single creature, sapping its strength. A target that fails to steel itself takes cold damage.
spell-green_flame_blade = Green-Flame Blade
spell-green_flame_blade-desc = The wielder swings an enchanted weapon, and on contact emerald fire erupts from the wound. The flames then leap to a second foe standing close beside the first, searing them as well.
spell-lightning_lure = Lightning Lure
spell-lightning_lure-desc = A crackling tether of electricity snaps out toward a nearby foe, yanking them closer when it bites. The lash sears them with lightning on contact.
spell-shocking_grasp = Shocking Grasp
spell-shocking_grasp-desc = A jolt of crackling current leaps from your palm into a foe you reach out to touch. The shock sears the body and snarls their nerves.
spell-sorcerous_burst = Sorcerous Burst
spell-sorcerous_burst-desc = The caster hurls a coil of raw magical energy at a single creature or object, requiring a ranged spell attack to strike true. The energy manifests as searing acid when it lands.
spell-starry_wisp = Starry Wisp
spell-starry_wisp-desc = You fling a glimmering mote of starlight at a single foe, searing it with radiant power.
spell-thunderclap = Thunderclap
spell-thunderclap-desc = The caster claps their hands to unleash a concussive crack of sound that ripples outward, battering every nearby creature with a wave of thunder. Those who fail to brace against the shock take the brunt of the blast.
spell-word_of_radiance = Word of Radiance
spell-word_of_radiance-desc = Speaking a sacred word, the caster releases a flash of searing light that scorches chosen foes nearby. Those who steel their bodies against the glare take less of the burning brilliance.
spell-caustic_brew = Caustic Brew
spell-caustic_brew-desc = A searing jet of corrosive fluid sprays outward in a long, narrow swath. Those caught in its path are doused in clinging acid that keeps eating away at them until they scrape it off.
spell-chaos_bolt = Chaos Bolt
spell-chaos_bolt-desc = The caster flings a churning knot of unstable energy at a single foe, resolved with a ranged spell attack. The mote's element shifts unpredictably each time it strikes.
spell-divine_favor = Divine Favor
spell-divine_favor-desc = A halo of sacred light wreathes your weapon, so your next blow sears the target with searing radiance.
spell-earth_tremor = Earth Tremor
spell-earth_tremor-desc = The caster slams a fist of will against the earth, and the ground bucks violently outward in a short radius. Everything caught in the quake is battered by churning stone unless it scrambles clear in time.
spell-frost_fingers = Frost Fingers
spell-frost_fingers-desc = A sudden gale of biting cold erupts from the caster's outstretched hand, sheeting everything before it in frost. Those caught in the blast endure searing chill unless they steel their bodies against it.
spell-hellish_rebuke = Hellish Rebuke
spell-hellish_rebuke-desc = In answer to a foe's blow, you fling a sudden gout of punishing flame at the one who struck you. The target attempts to dodge, taking searing fire damage that is lessened if it twists aside.
spell-spellfire_flare = Spellfire Flare
spell-spellfire_flare-desc = A searing bolt of holy fire streaks toward a foe, requiring a ranged spell attack to strike true. The radiant blaze burns so fiercely that little offers real protection from it.
spell-wayward_force_darts = Wayward Force Darts
spell-wayward_force_darts-desc = The caster flings several darts of pure force in rapid succession, each one streaking unerringly toward the same mark and battering it in a short, brutal volley.
spell-fire_bolt = Fire Bolt
spell-fire_bolt-desc = You hurl a mote of fire at a target, scorching it on a hit.
spell-ray_of_frost = Ray of Frost
spell-ray_of_frost-desc = A frigid beam of blue-white light streaks to a target, dealing cold damage and chilling it so it moves slower briefly.
spell-sacred_flame = Sacred Flame
spell-sacred_flame-desc = Flame-like radiance descends on a target, searing it where it stands.
spell-burning_hands = Burning Hands
spell-burning_hands-desc = A sheet of flame fans out from your spread fingers, burning everything in a short cone before you.
spell-chromatic_orb = Chromatic Orb
spell-chromatic_orb-desc = You hurl a crackling orb of raw elemental energy at a target, letting it burst into flame on impact.
spell-guiding_bolt = Guiding Bolt
spell-guiding_bolt-desc = A flash of radiant light strikes a foe and clings to it, making the next attack against it easier to land.
spell-thunderwave = Thunderwave
spell-thunderwave-desc = A wave of thunderous force sweeps out around you, damaging and shoving back everything caught in it.
spell-witch_bolt = Witch Bolt
spell-witch_bolt-desc = A crackling arc of lightning leaps to a foe and lingers, letting you sustain the current to shock it again and again.
spell-cure_wounds = Cure Wounds
spell-cure_wounds-desc = Your touch knits a wounded ally's flesh, restoring a surge of health.
spell-healing_word = Healing Word
spell-healing_word-desc = A swiftly-spoken word of power restores a measure of health to a touched ally.
spell-acid_arrow = Acid Arrow
spell-acid_arrow-desc = A streaking dart of caustic green energy hurtles toward a single foe. On impact it erupts into a corrosive spray that sears the target and keeps eating at them for a moment afterward.
spell-binding_ice = Binding Ice
spell-binding_ice-desc = A blast of freezing air sweeps outward in a wide cone, biting into everything caught before you. Those who endure the chill are left sluggish, their limbs slowed by clinging frost.
spell-flame_blade = Flame Blade
spell-flame_blade-desc = A blade of roaring flame springs into your open hand, shaped like a curved sword. You swing it at foes within reach, searing them with fire.
spell-gust_of_wind = Gust of Wind
spell-gust_of_wind-desc = A driving torrent of air howls outward in a straight line, shoving back any creature caught within it. The gale holds for as long as you keep it focused.
spell-moonbeam = Moonbeam
spell-moonbeam-desc = A shaft of cold silver light descends over a small patch of ground, searing any creature caught within its glow.
spell-prayer_of_healing = Prayer of Healing
spell-prayer_of_healing-desc = A spoken benediction settles over a handful of nearby companions, knitting their wounds in a shared moment of grace. Each chosen ally mends a measure of vitality at once.
spell-scorcher = Scorcher
spell-scorcher-desc = A searing ribbon of flame lances out in a straight line from your outstretched hand. Every creature caught along its path is scorched, though a quick dodge lessens the burn.
spell-snowball_swarm = Snowball Swarm
spell-snowball_swarm-desc = A sudden cluster of conjured snowballs detonates at a chosen point, pelting everyone nearby with biting cold. Those quick enough to dodge take only a fraction of the chill.
spell-spiritual_weapon = Spiritual Weapon
spell-spiritual_weapon-desc = A weapon shaped from raw force flickers into being and strikes at a foe with a phantom blow, ready to lunge anew at your will.
spell-warding_wind = Warding Wind
spell-warding_wind-desc = A roaring gale whips into being around you, swirling within a short radius and travelling wherever you walk. The churning air buffets anyone who tries to draw near.
spell-aura_of_vitality = Aura of Vitality
spell-aura_of_vitality-desc = A radius of restorative light surrounds you and follows your every step, knitting the wounds of those who linger within it.

spell-scorching_ray = Scorching Ray
spell-scorching_ray-desc = You loose three rays of fire, all streaking toward the same target, scorching it on impact.
spell-shatter = Shatter
spell-shatter-desc = A sudden ringing burst of sound erupts at a point, rattling everything nearby with thunderous force.
spell-cacophonic_shield = Cacophonic Shield
spell-cacophonic_shield-desc = A roaring lattice of sound wraps around you, and any creature that draws too close is worn down by the punishing din as long as they remain caught within the field.
spell-fireball = Fireball
spell-fireball-desc = A bead of flame streaks to a point and blossoms with a roar into a sphere of fire, engulfing all within.
spell-lightning_bolt = Lightning Bolt
spell-lightning_bolt-desc = A stroke of lightning flashes out in a line, instantly blasting everything along its length.
spell-mass_healing_word = Mass Healing Word
spell-mass_healing_word-desc = With a single shouted word of mending, the caster knits the wounds of every ally within earshot at once, each recovering a swift burst of vitality.
spell-minute_meteors = Minute Meteors
spell-minute_meteors-desc = The caster flings a pair of tiny burning motes that streak toward a target and burst into small gouts of flame on impact.
spell-silver_lance = Silver Lance
spell-silver_lance-desc = A lance of gleaming silver force erupts forward in a narrow line, skewering everyone caught along its path in an instant.
spell-wall_of_sand = Wall of Sand
spell-wall_of_sand-desc = A churning barrier of suspended sand rises from the ground at a chosen spot, forming a rough physical obstruction anything must scramble to push through.
spell-wall_of_water = Wall of Water
spell-wall_of_water-desc = You conjure a churning curtain of water that rises from the ground at a chosen spot, forming a barrier that holds as long as you keep your focus on it.
spell-wind_wall = Wind Wall
spell-wind_wall-desc = A vertical curtain of roaring wind springs from the ground at a chosen spot, forming a howling barrier that anything must fight through to cross.
spell-fire_shield = Fire Shield
spell-fire_shield-desc = Wispy flames coil around your body, casting light and warding you from temperature extremes.
spell-fount_of_moonlight = Fount of Moonlight
spell-fount_of_moonlight-desc = You cloak yourself in cold moonfire that lights the area around you while it lasts.
spell-ice_storm = Ice Storm
spell-ice_storm-desc = A churning column of jagged ice and frozen stone crashes down onto a chosen patch of ground, battering everything beneath it.
spell-sickening_radiance = Sickening Radiance
spell-sickening_radiance-desc = A pall of sickly green light fills a wide sphere, searing all who linger within it with debilitating radiance.
spell-spellfire_storm = Spellfire Storm
spell-spellfire_storm-desc = A towering column of searing holy fire erupts at a chosen spot, scorching everything caught within its radius.
spell-storm_sphere = Storm Sphere
spell-storm_sphere-desc = A churning globe of howling wind tears into being at a chosen point, battering anyone caught inside its swirling currents.
spell-vitriolic_sphere = Vitriolic Sphere
spell-vitriolic_sphere-desc = A glowing orb of caustic emerald fluid hurtles to a chosen point and bursts, drenching everything nearby in searing acid.
spell-wall_of_fire = Wall of Fire
spell-wall_of_fire-desc = A blazing barrier of conjured flame springs up along a surface you designate, holding its shape while you keep your focus.
spell-dawn = Dawn
spell-dawn-desc = A towering pillar of searing dawnlight blazes down upon a chosen spot, scorching everything caught within its radiance.
spell-destructive_wave = Destructive Wave
spell-destructive_wave-desc = You slam the ground, unleashing a sacred shockwave that radiates outward, battering foes with thunderous force and holy power.
spell-flame_strike = Flame Strike
spell-flame_strike-desc = A roaring pillar of sacred flame crashes down upon a chosen point, scorching all caught within its searing column.
spell-holy_weapon = Holy Weapon
spell-holy_weapon-desc = You channel sacred power into a weapon you touch, wreathing it in radiant light so its strikes sear foes with holy energy.
spell-immolation = Immolation
spell-immolation-desc = Roaring flames cling to a single creature you point out, searing it and continuing to burn it while your focus holds.
spell-maelstrom = Maelstrom
spell-maelstrom-desc = A churning whirlpool of water erupts across the ground, dragging creatures toward its center and battering them with the crushing pull of the current.
spell-mass_cure_wounds = Mass Cure Wounds
spell-mass_cure_wounds-desc = A surge of restorative light blossoms at a chosen point, knitting the wounds of several nearby allies at once.
spell-storm_of_radiance = Storm of Radiance
spell-storm_of_radiance-desc = A towering column of blinding light and crashing thunder erupts at a chosen point, searing every creature caught within it.
spell-conjured_hand = The Conjured Hand
spell-conjured_hand-desc = A huge hand woven from glimmering force takes shape at a chosen spot and obeys your will, striking foes or shoving them aside.
spell-wall_of_light = Wall of Light
spell-wall_of_light-desc = A shimmering barrier of pure light snaps into being, blinding and searing any creature caught within its glare.
spell-wall_of_stone = Wall of Stone
spell-wall_of_stone-desc = A barrier of solid stone rises from the ground at a chosen spot, raising panels of thick rock you can shape into a wall or an enclosing structure.
spell-blade_barrier = Blade Barrier
spell-blade_barrier-desc = A towering curtain of spinning, razor-edged blades wrought from raw energy springs up where you direct it.
spell-chain_lightning = Chain Lightning
spell-chain_lightning-desc = A searing bolt strikes a chosen foe, then splits into forks that leap to nearby enemies.
spell-freezing_sphere = Freezing Sphere
spell-freezing_sphere-desc = A glittering orb of absolute cold races to a chosen point and bursts, flash-freezing everything caught in the wide blast.
spell-heal = Heal
spell-heal-desc = A flood of restorative energy pours into a chosen creature, mending grievous wounds in an instant.
spell-sunbeam = Sunbeam
spell-sunbeam-desc = A searing shaft of pure daylight lances out in a straight line, scorching every creature caught in its path.
spell-wall_of_ice = Wall of Ice
spell-wall_of_ice-desc = You raise a barrier of solid ice on any surface in sight, shaped as a flat panel, a dome, or an enclosing sphere.
spell-crown_of_stars = Crown of Stars
spell-crown_of_stars-desc = A halo of seven blazing motes ignites around your head, wheeling like captive stars. With a flick of will you hurl the motes at foes, searing them with holy light.
spell-delayed_blast_fireball = Delayed Blast Fireball
spell-delayed_blast_fireball-desc = A glowing bead of fire hovers at a chosen point before erupting in a roaring blast that scorches everything nearby.
spell-fire_storm = Fire Storm
spell-fire_storm-desc = Roaring sheets of flame erupt across a chosen swath of ground, scorching everything caught within.
spell-spectral_blade = Spectral Blade
spell-spectral_blade-desc = A hovering blade of pure force takes shape near you, striking a chosen foe at a sharp command.
spell-whirlwind = Whirlwind
spell-whirlwind-desc = A roaring column of wind erupts from a chosen point on the ground, battering everything caught within its churning radius.
spell-earthquake = Earthquake
spell-earthquake-desc = You wrench the earth into a violent shudder, tearing open fissures and toppling whatever stands within the shaken ground.
spell-maddening_darkness = Maddening Darkness
spell-maddening_darkness-desc = A swelling globe of utter blackness swallows the area, snuffing out all light. Those trapped within feel their minds clawed at, suffering psychic torment.
spell-radiant_mote = Radiant Mote
spell-radiant_mote-desc = A brilliant spark of energy ignites overhead and follows you, bathing your surroundings in a sphere of light that reinforces your magic.
spell-sunburst = Sunburst
spell-sunburst-desc = A point you target erupts into a blinding flare of pure sunlight, searing everything within a wide radius with radiant energy.
spell-mass_heal = Mass Heal
spell-mass_heal-desc = A surge of restorative power radiates outward, knitting wounds across many nearby allies at once.
spell-meteor_swarm = Meteor Swarm
spell-meteor_swarm-desc = A searing orb streaks down from the sky and detonates at a chosen point, scorching everything within its blast radius.
spell-word_of_full_restoration = Word of Full Restoration
spell-word_of_full_restoration-desc = A single spoken word floods the touched creature with restorative power, mending its body to full vitality in an instant.
spell-cone_of_cold = Cone of Cold
spell-cone_of_cold-desc = A blast of frigid air erupts from your hands in a wide cone, freezing everything it touches.
